## 📌 About The Project

The **Simple Calculator** is a beginner-friendly Python project that performs essential arithmetic operations using an interactive command-line interface.

Users can enter two numbers, choose an arithmetic operator, and instantly get the calculated result.

This project focuses on understanding Python fundamentals and developing basic problem-solving skills through a practical application.

---

## ✨ Key Features

<table>
<tr>
<td width="50%">

### ➕ Addition
Performs addition of two numerical values.

### ➖ Subtraction
Calculates the difference between two numbers.

</td>
<td width="50%">

### ✖️ Multiplication
Multiplies two numerical values.

### ➗ Division
Divides two numbers with zero-division handling.

</td>
</tr>
</table>

### 🛡️ Additional Features

- Interactive user input.
- Arithmetic operator selection.
- Input type conversion.
- Basic exception handling.
- Simple and beginner-friendly execution.

